<title>THAILAND: Thai Farmers cuts MLR by 25 basis points.</title>
<headline>Thai Farmers cuts MLR by 25 basis points.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Farmers Bank Plc said on Monday it would cut its minimum lending rate (MLR) by 25 basis points to 12.75 percentage, effective from May 28.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
